TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY sta_import

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK ../station_maintenance/station_maintenance.html#sta_import

DESCRIPTION <b>sta_import</b> is one of a collection of tools developed
to manage station metadata in an Earthworm database.  <b>sta_import</b>
fills an Earthworm database with station metadata read from 
a flat file that was written by <b>sta_export</b>.  Please see the details
page for more information.
